### Maven ###
target/
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.properties
# maven-shade-plugin output. Only useful when publishing to a Maven repo so
# consumers don't inherit shaded deps — this plugin ships as a JAR on GitHub
# Releases, so it serves no purpose. Generation is disabled in pom.xml
# (createDependencyReducedPom), this entry just guards against it coming back.
dependency-reduced-pom.xml

